WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:05.594
When a candidate walks in late without a word, the jury has already formed an opinion.

2
00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:09.324
If you know you will be late, call before the interview starts.

3
00:00:09.364 --> 00:00:13.810
When you arrive, greet everyone, apologise once, and move on.

4
00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:16.059
And never blame the traffic.
